    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Odyssey Fight is a battle arena video game where you'll choose one of more than 40 characters to fight in the victorious arenas.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create runes to improve your character's base stats</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet people and make friends</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as a team and defeat the opposing team with their turrets and Nexus!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play in the free-for-all arenas and have fun getting to know your favorite character in depth.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Climb the ranked ladder to become the Grand Champion of Valhalla.</strong></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Odyssey Fight is a battle arena video game where you'll choose one of more than 40 characters to fight in the victorious arenas.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create runes to improve your character's base stats</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet people and make friends</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as a team and defeat the opposing team with their turrets and Nexus!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play in the free-for-all arenas and have fun getting to know your favorite character in depth.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Climb the ranked ladder to become the Grand Champion of Valhalla.</strong></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Enter the new battle arena experience, choose one of 40 characters and enter the battlefield to be the best of all!",
